;Absolute minimum calibrated defocus is greater than absolute maximum calibrated defocus.
;
linked_em_imaging_calibrated_defocus_min_1 em_imaging calibrated_defocus_min em_imaging calibrated_defocus_max id . > . . . yes
;Absolute minimum calibrated defocus is greater than absolute maximum calibrated defocus.
